'''Tungsten''' is a {{Common}} [[Dwarven Metal]] in the {{Skill|Mining}} Collection.

== Collection ==
Collecting '''Tungsten''' increases the player's Tungsten [[collections|collection]], which grants useful items and perks upon collecting certain amounts of '''Tungsten'''.

{{/Collection UI}}

{{CollectionTable|Tungsten}}

== Obtaining ==
'''Tungsten''' is obtained from mining {{Item|Cobblestone}} or {{Item|Clay Block|text=Clay}} blocks in the {{Zone|Glacite Tunnels}} or {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}. In {{Zone|Glacite Mineshafts}}, it can also take the appearance of {{Item|Cobblestone Slab}} or {{Item|Cobblestone Stairs}}. It requires {{Stat|Breaking Power|9}} to mine. All types have {{Green|5,600}} [[Block Strength]], but the amount of base drops varies.

